    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LinearLogic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Implication";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "First data holder not required to disclose product data if second data holder offers it.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(4) If: (a) a data holder (the first data holder) receives a request for CDR data that relates to a product (the relevant product); and (b) the first data holder offers the relevant product on behalf of another data holder (the second data holder), such that the second data holder is the data holder that enters into contracts with consumers to provide the relevant product;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "...the first data holder is not required to disclose the requested required product data under subrule (3).";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::linear";
