    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "If this rule does not apply, rule 7.13 applies: see subrule 7.13(1).";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "If this rule does not apply, then rule 7.13 applies.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The CDR consumer BUT the time the statement was given and the current time NOT deleted redundant data IF this rule does not apply THEN rule 7.13 applies: see subrule 7.13(1).";
