    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "MAY";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The accredited person thinks it appropriate in the circumstances to de-identify rather than delete the redundant data.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "In the case of a statement referred to in paragraph 4.17(1)(c)―the accredited person THINKS IT IS_A appropriate in the circumstances to de-identify rather than delete the redundant data.";
